    "https://uwaterloo.ca/careers/current-opportunities/faculty-opportunities": {
      "title": "Faculty opportunities",
      "description": "Faculty opportunities | Careers at Waterloo | University of Waterloo Skip to main content Jump to Jump to Admissions About Waterloo Faculties & Academics Offices & Services Support Waterloo Open Search Location Search for Search Location On all sites On this site Careers at Waterloo Menu Careers at Waterloo Home Current Opportunities Current Opportunities Current Waterloo Employees Future Waterloo Employees Faculty opportunities Affiliated and Federated institutions Executive opportunities Casual and other opportunities Hiring Process at Waterloo Commitment to Equity Human Resources Faculty opportunities At the University of Waterloo, we offer a dynamic range of opportunities for academics, researchers, and entrepreneurs at every stage of their careers. Waterloo provides a collaborative environment that fosters innovation, interdisciplinary research, and entrepreneurial thinking. Our commitment to excellence in teaching, research, and commercialization makes Waterloo a unique place to grow your academic and professional journey. Faculty positions across our campuses, departments and professional schools, and affiliated research institutes are regularly posted on our faculty careers site. These include roles in teaching, research, and entrepreneurship, reflecting our integrated approach to academic excellence and real-world impact. We welcome scholars who are passionate about advancing knowledge, driving innovation, and contributing to Waterloo’s vibrant ecosystem of research and entrepreneurship. Academic opportunities are located on our faculty websites: Faculty of Arts Faculty of Health Faculty of Engineering Faculty of Math Faculty of Environment Faculty of Science Information about Careers at Waterloo LinkedIn LinkedIn Human Resources East Campus 1 175 Columbia Street West Waterloo, ON, Canada N2L 3G1 519-888-4567, ext. 45935 Questions? Please contact us at hrhelp@uwaterloo.ca with any questions or comments. Workday access → Hiring manager support → Contact us → Information about the University of Waterloo University of Waterloo University of Waterloo 43.471468 -80.544205 Campus map Campus map 200 University Avenue West Waterloo , ON , Canada N2L 3G1 +1 519 888 4567 Contact Waterloo Campus status News Maps & directions Accessibility Careers Emergency notifications Privacy Feedback The University of Waterloo acknowledges that much of our work takes place on the traditional territory of the Neutral, Anishinaabeg, and Haudenosaunee peoples. Our main campus is situated on the Haldimand Tract, the land granted to the Six Nations that includes six miles on each side of the Grand River. Our active work toward reconciliation takes place across our campuses through research, learning, teaching, and community building, and is co-ordinated within the Office of Indigenous Relations . Instagram Instagram LinkedIn LinkedIn Facebook Facebook YouTube YouTube @uwaterloo social directory On It Check WHERE THERE’S A CHALLENGE, WATERLOO IS ON IT . Learn how   → ©2026 All rights reserved We use cookies on this site to enhance your user experience Select 'Accept all' to agree and continue. You consent to our cookies if you continue to use this website. Accept all"
