    "https://uwaterloo.ca/engineering/faculty-and-staff/faculty-openings": {
      "title": "Faculty openings",
      "description": "Faculty openings | Engineering | University of Waterloo Skip to main content Jump to Jump to Admissions About Waterloo Faculties & Academics Offices & Services Support Waterloo Open Search Location Search for Search Location On all sites On this site Engineering Menu Engineering Home About About Our history Engineering pin Heritage Project Territorial acknowledgement Our people Dean of Engineering Dean's Advisory Council Research Advisory Committee Departments, Schools and Programs Outreach and Diversity Strategic Plan Engineering Rankings Faculty of Engineering Statistics Publications Research Research Centres and Institutes Industry partnerships Labs and Facilities Research Chairs and Awards Research videos Resources for researchers Entrepreneurship Entrepreneurship Funding Engineer of the Future Fund Insight To Creation Speaker Series News Events Events Digital Screen Advertisement Request Form Engineering events & initiatives promotion request form Contact us Future Students Future Students Why engineering? Take the engineering program compatibility quiz Choose a program Applying Paying for school After accepting Explore future careers Learn more about co-op Get involved in student life​ Connect with us Interested in Graduate Studies? Undergraduate Students Undergraduate Students First year Academics Accreditation unit information Altering course load Graduate attributes Courses and enrolment GENE courses Letter of permission Projected course offerings Promotion rules Non-degree term Co-op Co-op streams Co-op Fundamentals for Engineering (CFE) Professional development Getting support Academic advising Accessibility Counselling Declaring absences Engineering undergrad office Engineering wellness International students Programs in Engineering Degree enhancement Accelerated Master's Programs Exchange Options Research opportunities Specializations and more Policies and regulations​ Academic integrity Petitions, Grievances and Requests for Reass